Started playing last summer, then sort of quit while term started up
again. As soon as Spring finals were over, started playing hardcore
again. This was the first game in which I had ever got to XL 14 and
was able to do the Quest.

Damn, Valks are _tanks_ when they start buying protection and get
Mjollnir. My wishes at the Castle were (I already had boots of speed
and SDSM):

2 blessed scrolls of charging
+2 blessed greased fireproof cloak of MR
blessed ring of levitation
+2 blessed fireproof gauntlets of power
amulet of life saving

Anyway, I won't bore you with too many details, suffice it to say that
I was well on my way to getting the Amulet until I _put an
unidentified wand (in reality, cancellation) into a bag of holding_
and blew up like half of my nice stuff. Minetown didn't have seven
more candles, so I polypiled a lot of tools and got enough with the
_last wrested charge_. How's that for excitement? :) I sat on a throne
and wished for my ring of levitation back, and then it was onto
Gehennom and DIVE DIVE DIVE and RUN RUN RUN, respectively.

Nothing had been a real challenge ever since the Quest (I guess this
is why they say Valks are easy), except for the damn high priestess of
Moloch in the Sanctum; her speed is obnoxious. The portals in the
Planes were something of a challenge. My Int was low, so scrying with
the Orb was risky, and I didn't know about the other methods. Had some
very close calls on the plane of air....

And then I was in the Astral plane. I have no idea how I would have
survived without conflict. Anyway, I walked straight forward and
ascended!

